WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:06.939
This morning the diner was even busier than usual.

2
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.977
"Whew!" Ally thought.

3
00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:13.738
A whole busload of museum visitors had stopped for breakfast.

4
00:00:13.739 --> 00:00:18.298
Then Ray went home to change for his meeting with the Big City Foods CEO.

5
00:00:18.299 --> 00:00:25.021
So Flo helped Randy in the kitchen, leaving Ally serving all the tables on her own.

6
00:00:25.022 --> 00:00:28.212
Finally the last few customers left.

7
00:00:28.213 --> 00:00:30.649
"I've been so busy," Ally thought.

8
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.794
"I forgot to listen for a chiming sound from Alpha.

9
00:00:33.795 --> 00:00:37.759
I'd better go and check on her before the lunch crowd arrives."

10
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:44.526
But just as Ally headed for the office, two men in suits entered the diner.

11
00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:49.379
With a sigh, Ally grabbed two menus and went to greet the customers.

12
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.219
"Hello, would you like a . . ." Ally stopped.

13
00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.782
One of the men was Ray!

14
00:00:55.783 --> 00:00:58.719
She hadn't recognized him in the suit!

15
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.139
"Hello, Ally," Ray said.

16
00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.893
"I'd like you to meet Mr. Owens from Big City Foods."

17
00:01:03.894 --> 00:01:07.459
"Nice to meet you, sir," Ally said.

18
00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:12.844
"Ally is one of our best servers," Ray said, leading Mr. Owens to a booth.

19
00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:14.989
"Thanks, Ray," Ally said.

20
00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:17.704
"I'll be right back with your lunch."

21
00:01:17.705 --> 00:01:23.478
Ally quickly served Ray and Mr. Owens the special meal that Ray had prepared for their meeting.

22
00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:26.136
Then she rushed back to the office.

23
00:01:26.137 --> 00:01:31.905
"Alpha, talk to me. Have you been scanning customers?" Ally asked.

24
00:01:31.906 --> 00:01:39.432
"Affirmative. I have detected no Jorgandians or other life-forms from space, only Earthlings."

25
00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:42.015
"Well, keep working," Ally said.

26
00:01:42.016 --> 00:01:43.993
"Tina might come in soon.

27
00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:51.440
Remember to make a loud chime if you detect anything, so I can hear you from out in the dining room."

28
00:01:51.441 --> 00:01:58.140
Ally went back to work. As she was wiping down the counter, more customers came in.

29
00:01:58.141 --> 00:02:03.579
"There's Tina!" Ally gulped. "Be brave, Allyzooba!

30
00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.928
That's what your parents would say."

31
00:02:06.929 --> 00:02:14.442
Ally tried to sound relaxed, but her voice came out high and squeaky. "Hello, Tina."

32
00:02:14.443 --> 00:02:17.766
"Hello, Ally." Tina sat at the counter.

33
00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:22.890
"I hear the diner is offering a free lunch to new residents of Sandville."

34
00:02:22.891 --> 00:02:24.604
"Yep, yep, yep!" Ally said.

35
00:02:24.605 --> 00:02:28.696
"Ugh! Calm down!" Ally scolded herself.

36
00:02:28.697 --> 00:02:33.100
"Tina can't hurt you when there are humans around."

37
00:02:33.101 --> 00:02:37.339
"So, what can I get you, Tina?"

38
00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:42.099
"A Beta Burgana," Tina said. "With a side of fries."

39
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:50.541
"Sure thing!" Ally gave Randy the order, then asked Flo to cover for her in the dining room for a second.

40
00:02:50.542 --> 00:02:55.699
Ally dashed into Ray's office. "Alpha! Did you scan Tina?"

41
00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.719
Alpha didn't answer.

42
00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.232
"Alpha, you can talk," Ally said.

43
00:03:00.233 --> 00:03:03.392
"I didn't hear you chime, but Tina is here."

44
00:03:03.393 --> 00:03:08.923
"You did not hear me chime because I have not found any Jorgandians," Alpha said.

45
00:03:08.924 --> 00:03:18.066
"What?" Ally said. "Whoa. Was I wrong about Tina, just like I was wrong about Melanie?"

46
00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:23.891
Ally went back into the dining room, puzzled. "If Tina isn't the Jorgandian, then . . ."

47
00:03:23.892 --> 00:03:33.000
"Ally!" Tina waved her over. "Can I talk to you?"

48
00:03:33.001 --> 00:03:36.476
Tina had only taken one bite out of her burger.

49
00:03:36.477 --> 00:03:39.814
"Is something wrong with your burger?" Ally asked.

50
00:03:39.815 --> 00:03:46.063
"No. It's delicious. But it reminds me of something I've had before."

51
00:03:46.064 --> 00:03:49.246
"Oh, really?" Ally said. "What's that?"

52
00:03:49.247 --> 00:03:55.093
Tina leaned in closer. "A burger on Beta Burgana."

53
00:03:55.094 --> 00:03:59.737
Ally's mouth fell open. "Alpha missed it!" she thought.

54
00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:03.074
"Tina is the Jorgandian!"

55
00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:08.259
"We need to talk. Now. Alone," Tina whispered.

56
00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.845
"Alone?" Ally looked around in a panic.

57
00:04:11.846 --> 00:04:17.996
"Uh . . . I'm super busy right now. Right, Flo? I'm too busy to leave?"

58
00:04:17.997 --> 00:04:22.428
Flo shrugged. "It's actually pretty quiet right now.

59
00:04:22.429 --> 00:04:26.812
And Randy doesn't need help in the kitchen."

60
00:04:26.813 --> 00:04:31.916
"Unless you want to make a scene, you must come with me," Tina said.

61
00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:34.210
"And bring your computer along."

62
00:04:34.211 --> 00:04:38.950
Ally wanted to run away, but there'd be no running from a Jorgandian.

63
00:04:38.951 --> 00:04:43.356
"Fine. I'll be right back."

64
00:04:43.357 --> 00:04:49.911
Ally went into the office, unplugged Alpha, and put the machine into the wagon she and Mateo had used earlier.

65
00:04:49.912 --> 00:04:54.672
Her mind was whirling, but she couldn't think of a way to stop what was happening.

66
00:04:54.673 --> 00:04:57.741
"I don't want to be evaporated," Ally thought.

67
00:04:57.742 --> 00:05:08.030
"But I must be brave." Pulling Alpha behind her, she followed Tina outside and into an alley.

68
00:05:08.031 --> 00:05:12.477
"Please," Ally begged. "Don't evaporate me yet.

69
00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:15.646
My parents don't know what happened to me.

70
00:05:15.647 --> 00:05:21.249
Please give me a chance to send them a message so I can say good-bye."

71
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.316
"Good-bye?" Tina blinked.

72
00:05:24.317 --> 00:05:29.386
"You've got your human words mixed up. Don't you mean, hello?"

73
00:05:29.387 --> 00:05:32.577
"What?" Ally was confused.

74
00:05:32.578 --> 00:05:36.504
Tina grinned. "I am Commander Tinakron.

75
00:05:36.505 --> 00:05:41.883
I was sent to Earth from Astralia to bring you back home!"

